{"id":"ddfda06bbcc2ec7b","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-fibred-preorder.md","title":"预序纤维化","display":"df-fibred-preorder — 预序纤维化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-fibred-preorder","display":"df-fibred-preorder — 预序纤维化","depends_on":["[[16-df-fibration]]","[[16-df-fibre]]"],"source":"Exercise 1.3.11 p.47 (PDF67); Definition 3.5.1 p.201 (PDF221); §4.2 p.233 (PDF253)","revision_date":"2026-10-16","aliases":["16-df-fibred-preorder"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-fibred-preorder"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fibred-preorder — 预序纤维化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" href=\"?note=aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" title=\"16-df-fibre\">16-df-fibre</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Exercise 1.3.11 p.47 (PDF67); Definition 3.5.1 p.201 (PDF221); §4.2 p.233 (PDF253)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-fibred-preorder</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为纤维化，纤维采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" href=\"?note=aa1ce0bab1ae8910\" title=\"16-df-fibre\">16-df-fibre</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\">\\(X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_I\">\\(\\leq_I\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq_I\">\\(\\simeq_I\\)</span> 是下文定义的纤维可达关系及双向可达关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fib}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fib}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibPre}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibPre}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\leq_IY\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X,Y)\\ne\\varnothing,\\qquad\nX\\simeq_IY\\Longleftrightarrow X\\leq_IY\\land Y\\leq_IX.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\leq_IY\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X,Y)\\ne\\varnothing,\\qquad\nX\\simeq_IY\\Longleftrightarrow X\\leq_IY\\land Y\\leq_IX.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fibred\\text{-}preorder}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{FibPre}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Fib}(p)\\land(\\forall I\\in\\mathcal B)(\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathcal E_I)\\\n|\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X,Y)|\\leq1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fibred\\text{-}preorder}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{FibPre}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Fib}(p)\\land(\\forall I\\in\\mathcal B)(\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathcal E_I)\\\n|\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X,Y)|\\leq1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>预序只保证垂直箭头至多唯一，不保证互相可达的对象字面相等；取同构类后才成为偏序。</li>\n<li>在后续逻辑原子中，同构常写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span>，不把它改成记录相等。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Exercise 1.3.11, p.47 (PDF67); Definition 3.5.1, p.201 (PDF221); §4.2, p.233 (PDF253)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibre","status":"resolved","id":"aa1ce0bab1ae8910","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibre]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibre","status":"resolved","id":"aa1ce0bab1ae8910","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化，纤维采用 [[16-df-fibre]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fib}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-fibration]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibPre}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\leq_IY\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X,Y)\\ne\\varnothing,\\qquad\nX\\simeq_IY\\Longleftrightarrow X\\leq_IY\\land Y\\leq_IX.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fibred\\text{-}preorder}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{FibPre}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Fib}(p)\\land(\\forall I\\in\\mathcal B)(\\forall X,Y\\in\\mathcal E_I)\\\n|\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E_I}(X,Y)|\\leq1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\simeq","display":false}],"bytes":1595,"backlinks":[{"id":"6fdaaa990a4fe51a","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$u^*$ 在以下公式中表示 $q$ 的重索引；$\\leq_I$、$\\simeq_I$ 是预序纤维 $\\mathcal D_I$ 中的可达关系与双向可达关系，见 [[16-df-fibred-preorder]]。$\\langle a,b\\rangle$ 表示上述拉回中由两分量唯一确定的箭头。"},{"id":"478c99d853e13c93","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；预序、纤维有限积、简单等式分别见 [[16-df-fibred-preorder]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]、[[16-df-eq-functor]]。"},{"id":"ae1a27a060629395","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为 [[16-df-fibred-preorder]] 的预序纤维化；沿 $u:I\\to J$ 的重索引 $u^*$ 采用 [[16-df-substitution]]。"},{"id":"eeefa02192bbb359","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$O_I=\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_I$；$\\leq_I,\\simeq_I$ 采用 [[16-df-fibred-preorder]] 的箭头存在关系及双向可达关系。$\\pi_{I,J}:I\\times J\\to I$ 为第一投影，$\\delta_{I,J}=\\langle\\operatorname{id}_{I\\times J},\\pi_2^{I,J}\\rangle$。$I,J,K$ 遍历基底对象。"},{"id":"6c23c06c4d297e8d","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$ 沿 [[16-df-slice-category]] 的同一编码使用；$\\kappa$ 是末式给出的提升族，$\\mathrm{SplitFib}$、$\\mathrm{FibPre}$ 采用 [[16-df-split-fibration]]、[[16-df-fibred-preorder]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-237","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-preorder|df-fibred-preorder — 预序纤维化]]"},{"id":"e59beb3704642c3f","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FibPre}(q)$ 采用 [[16-df-fibred-preorder]]。下文 $\\le_J$ 是本页定义的纤维箭头存在关系；只有在附加预序纤维条件下才把它作为命题逻辑的序解释。"}],"outgoing":["c9801f31ec8ac53f","aa1ce0bab1ae8910"]}